# New features

1. Create `src/features/<name>/{components,lib,hooks}` before adding a fat `app/` file.
2. Keep the route a default-export wrapper around feature UI.
3. API functions in `src/api`; models in `src/types`.
4. Shared only after a second feature needs the same module.
5. Gate with `canAccessSegment` / `isPersonalWorkspace`.
6. Sheets that edit data should use tall `BottomSheet` (`fullHeight` for forms).
7. Run `npm run typecheck`.
